@{ Layout = "_LayoutPublic"; ViewData["Title"] = "Enterprise Gemini Agent Operations Platform"; }
<section class="spx-hero spx-hero--cinematic">
  <div class="container spx-hero__grid">
    <div><span class="spx-kicker">Prototype · pilot-ready architecture · synthetic demo data</span><h1>AI-powered smart port execution from control room to fleet owner to driver.</h1><p class="spx-lead">A premium enterprise logistics AI sandbox: control room signals flow into a Gemini/fallback agent, execution plans, fleet owner action, WhatsApp and driver companion updates, audit trail, and measurable idling/CO₂ impact.</p><div class="spx-actions"><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary sp-btn--lg" href="/demo-access">Demo Access</a><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline sp-btn--lg" href="/demo-tour">Start Judge Tour</a><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline sp-btn--lg" href="/enterprise-readiness">View Enterprise Readiness</a></div><p class="spx-note">Synthetic operational scenario for judging. Pilot connectors can ingest IPMS/TOS, berth schedules, gate systems, fleet GPS, driver app, WhatsApp Cloud API, ERP, weather/disruption feeds, and emissions data. No live customer integration is claimed.</p></div>
    <img src="/images/smart-port-hero.svg" alt="Smart Port AI control room original illustration" />
  </div>
</section>
<section class="container spx-section"><span class="spx-kicker">From signal to execution</span><h2>Complete operational loop</h2><div class="spx-module-grid">@foreach (var item in new[] { "Public story", "Identity demo login", "Port Admin command centre", "Gemini Operations Agent", "Execution plan", "Fleet owner action", "WhatsApp/driver companion", "Mobile API status", "Driver confirmation", "Updated queue state", "Audit trail", "Emissions report" }) { <article class="spx-module-card"><strong>@item</strong><p>Connected in the demo as a human-approved workflow step.</p></article> }</div></section>
<section class="container spx-section spx-visual-grid"><img src="/images/control-room-panel.svg" alt="AI control room visual"/><div><span class="spx-kicker">Gemini Agent module</span><h2>Not just a chatbot</h2><p>The Gemini Operations Agent combines structured truck queue, gate pressure, berth readiness, driver confirmation, WhatsApp state and idling estimates, then compares deterministic fallback with Gemini-enhanced explanation.</p><div class="spx-actions"><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary" href="/gemini-agent">Open Gemini Agent</a><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="/driver/demo">View Driver Companion</a></div></div></section>
<section class="container spx-section"><div class="spx-module-grid spx-module-grid--features">
<article class="spx-module-card"><img src="/images/fleet-driver-loop.svg" alt="Fleet driver loop"/><h3>Fleet Owner</h3><p>Request location, send demo WhatsApp, move to staging, release to gate, reschedule, mark exception, or ask Gemini.</p></article>
<article class="spx-module-card"><img src="/images/mobile-driver-companion.svg" alt="Android companion"/><h3>Driver Companion</h3><p>Driver web companion, WhatsApp updates and mobile API are primary; optional Android source/APK uses demo tokens and stores no Gemini or WhatsApp secrets.</p></article>
<article class="spx-module-card"><img src="/images/gemini-agent-flow.svg" alt="Gemini agent flow"/><h3>Audit & Governance</h3><p>Every recommendation is framed as human-approved, reversible and visible in demo history.</p></article>
</div></section>
<section class="container spx-section spx-pilot"><span class="spx-kicker">Honest pilot integration path</span><h2>Connector-ready, not pretending to be live</h2><p>Smart Port is designed to connect to approved port, fleet, GPS, WhatsApp and energy data sources in a pilot. This submission uses synthetic demo data, explicit disclaimers and safe fallback behavior.</p><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="/enterprise-readiness">Enterprise readiness checklist</a></section>
